# Mimeoplasm exiles Kalitas, Traitor of Ghet as it enters and becomes a copy of it. When Bot2's Grizzly Bears would die
# to Lightning Bolt, the copied Kalitas's replacement effect exiles it instead (and makes a Zombie): Mimeoplasm exiled it,
# though the Bolt's resolution moved it. The owner's ruling (jschibel, 2026-11-24) - "exiled with it" reads every creature
# card this object exiled, however it exiled it - lets Mimeoplasm become a copy of that Bears, a 0/0 with three +1/+1
# counters.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Entomb
Mimeoplasm, Revered One
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x10
Kalitas, Traitor of Ghet

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Grizzly Bears
Island x4
Island x20

